<title>USA: ImmunoTherapeutics changes name.</title>
<headline>ImmunoTherapeutics changes name.</headline>
<dateline>FARGO, N.D. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>ImmunoTherapeutics Inc said Monday it changed its name to Endorex Corp.</p>
<p>The name change was approved by shareholders at a meeting last month and is effective immediately, the company said.</p>
<p>The company will now trade on the Nasdaq bulletin board under the ticker symbol ENDU. It previously traded as IMNP.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
